ally handle  this and if I can't I need to do  something a bit more substantive than  just throwing questions out there onto  the internet and hoping that somebody  will come along and provide me with an  answer because you know quite frankly  how do you know that the answers that  you're getting are actually on track if  you don't know enough about the topic  another thing to keep in mind is that  when it comes to those who are providing  answers like myself and it's  understandable that you would post  questions on my videos because I do in  fact talk about a lot of different  topics in philosophy those of us who are  working at a fairly high level and have  a lot of background and expertise to  draw upon are usually pretty busy so you  know if if I were to try to answer every  single question that gets put to me I  would require more than the 24 hours  that I have in a day so I frequently  don't address things that look like  people just looking for homework answers  or test prep answers if you're looking  for a substantive engagement on my part  in answering your questions of these  these types then you probably want to  consider booking me for a tutorial  session like what my other clients do my  time is in short supply and is valuable  and the expertise that I have to bring  can be very helpful for you not only in  dealing with whatever individual  question you have but in understanding  where it fits into the the wider realm  of philosophy but you know I I can only  do so much of that I already do answer  questions in my AMAs other online events  you know I do in fact address quite a  few questions and queries on social  media and YouTube so if what you want is  is somebody to walk you through the  stuff and help you understand it  consider the tutorial sessions otherwise  you know good luck with what you're  doing and I think you know just keep  plowing away at it and you will find the  answers that work for you and you want  to keep them up here in your own